@ Index:  Gamma function RPN plot demo
@ Author: Jaco Mostert
@ Tested: XEQ ‘TSTPLOT’
@ Input:  none
@ Output: On-screen Γ(𝑥) plot over [-2, 2] with poles at 0, -1, -2
LBL :TST:
  MVAR ‘x’
  RCL ‘x’
  Γ(𝑥)
  RTN

LBL ‘TSTPLOT’
  PLTRST
  -2
  2
  PLTRST
  CF ‘PLbox’
  SF ‘PLx.ax’
  SF ‘PLy.ax’
  PGMPLT :TST:
  PLTf ‘x’
  OPENM ‘PLFUNC’
  END
.END.
